// A ball with a post joined to it, the edge where they meet rounded.
//
// Refused: Firmament has no union of solids. A Sphere is a standalone body, a coaxial Compose joins
// only Cylinder and Frustum spans, and Revolve admits an arc in its meridian only as a semicircle
// closed by its diameter, so the ball and post cannot be made one solid, nor their edge rounded.
